Subject: [PATCH] D8b: marking income Arrived says "Marked arrived."

The schedules list labels the button "Arrived" on an income schedule and
"Paid" on a bill (money in is income), but both answered "Marked paid.",
so a salary was confirmed in the words of a bill. The reply now follows
the same rule as the button.

Test: schedule-arrived.test.ts posts both and reads the notice.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016zXWwzys3K4XksLh3rrcKu
